{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんこんばんは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新内眞衣です！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/05/02/3873570/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"むに～っとな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえばね！\nこないだの週末は\n初めて休日出勤というものを\n体験してきました←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"短い時間だったけど、\nなんか社会人の大変さを\n改めて実感したなー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"世の中の社会人の皆様\n本当にお疲れ様です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その日はOLの後に\nプリンシパルのお稽古や\nアンダーライブのリハを\n夜遅くまでやって、\nくたくたでご帰宅(￣^￣)ゞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも忙しいのは嫌いじゃないんだ！\n無駄な1日を過ごすより\n充実してるのは良いことだもんね！\n前向きに！前向きに！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでも、この１週間は割と\nタイトなスケジュールだったので\n体調を崩さなかった\n自分を褒めてあげたいです！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/05/02/3873570/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(ご褒美にまだ飲めてない\nスタバのバナナの高いやつ\n飲みに行こーっと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/05/02/3873570/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":")"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こういうプチご褒美って\nテンション上がるよね(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆は頑張った時には\nどんなプチご褒美を\n取り入れてるのかな？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良かったら教えて下さいね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/05/02/3873570/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この調子で5月も頑張ります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/05/02/3873570/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってなわけで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/05/02/3873570/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お知らせ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/05/02/3873570/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/05/02/3873570/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"EX大衆\nかりん・らんぜ・みり愛と\n取材させて頂きました(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ\n２期生相関図\nぜひチェックして下さいね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/05/02/3873570/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木ここ！\nアンダーライブに\n密着していただきました！\n正直、密着されていた\n実感なんて全くなかったので\n変な顔ばかりしてましたorz"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段は見られない\nいろんな素が出ているので\n良かったら注目して見て下さい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/05/02/3873570/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"YOU PEPER\nこないだ取材していただきました。\n５月号に載るので、\nチェックして下さいね～(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フリーペーパーですので是非"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/05/02/3873570/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は！！！\nついにアンダーライブ！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1ヶ月前、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"予定人数に達してないと\n知った時は本当に\n皆で落ち込みました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日どれだけの人が\n来てくれるのかな？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶対『行って良かった！』って\n言って貰えるようなライブに\nしたいと思ってますので\nよろしくお願いします(｀_´)ゞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/05/02/3873570/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もたくさんリハしてきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここでしか見られない\nあんな曲やこんな曲を\nやっちゃうかもしれないよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/05/02/3873570/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれる人は最高の\n思い出にしましょう(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは！\n明日待ってるね♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/05/02/3873570/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"眞衣"}],"source":"archive"}